                  - text: of the context manager.
              - paragraph:
                - text: Example of catching
                - link [ref=f83e744]:
                  - /url: ../builtins/exceptions.html#TimeoutError
                  - code: TimeoutError
                - text: ":"
              - generic: "async def main(): try: async with asyncio.timeout(10): await long_running_task() except TimeoutError: print(\"The long operation timed out, but we've handled it.\") print(\"This statement will run regardless.\")"
              - paragraph:
                - text: The context manager produced by
                - link [ref=f83e750]:
                  - /url: "#asyncio.timeout"
                  - code: asyncio.timeout()
                - text: can be rescheduled to a different deadline and inspected.
              - generic:
                - term:
                  - emphasis:
                    - generic: class
